.env
certs/

# ResNet-50 pest classifier: raw image datasets, generated crops, and the
# trained model itself are all too large/numerous for git (the model alone
# exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file limit). Code, logs, and metrics JSON stay
# tracked so the exact model can be reproduced by rerunning the pipeline
# against a local copy of the dataset — see ml/resnet/README (if present) or
# ml/resnet/prepare_dataset.py + train.py docstrings for the run commands.
ml/resnet/bph/
ml/resnet/sb/
ml/resnet/negative/
ml/resnet/unidentified/
ml/resnet/unknown_negatives/
ml/resnet/datasets/
ml/weights/*/resnet50_*.keras
ml/weights/*/resnet50_*.meta.json

# Generated synthetic images (ml/synthetic/generate_coverage_dataset.py) —
# reproducible from the already-tracked script + the real crops/backgrounds
# above, same reasoning as ml/resnet/datasets/.
ml/synthetic/datasets/

# Roboflow-exported rice growth-stage photo set used as source material for
# ml/synthetic/generate_hopperburn_procedural.py / generate_hopperburn_dataset.py
# — large raw image dump, not reproducible from code, kept out of git like
# the other raw datasets above.
ml/new/
